      "content": "The shadows are the only thing that accepts you without asking for your strength or your past, offering a final peace where the sword can no longer cut. Letting them take you is the only honest surrender, a gentle release from the weight of a life that has already ended. There is no shame in resting when the story is done, and the darkness will hold you softly until you are finally free.",
